#nop ── mage.tin ── read while the mage's session is current ───────────
#nop
#nop A level-1 mage cannot finish a fight: it hits for two to five against
#nop training mobs that take twenty, and the mob wanders off or kills it
#nop first. Grouped behind a warrior it takes a share of every kill instead
#nop of all of nothing, which is the whole reason the crew exists rather
#nop than four characters grinding separately.
#nop
#nop Unlike the cleric, a mage has both its attack and its armor at level 1.

#variable {role[$session]}      {mage}
#variable {atk[$session]}       {cast 'magic missile'}
#variable {atkspell[$session]}  {magic missile}
#variable {heal[$session]}      {}
#variable {buffspell[$session]} {armor}
#variable {wimpy[$session]}     {30}
#variable {isleader[$session]}    {}
